+# Staged-test provenance header correction
+
+The current test header identifies the six reports as blinded independent R3
+oracle copies. They were frozen after the implementation existed. Independence
+rests on blinding. This corrects findingF1 from the previous final Opus review.
+Only the first four module-comment lines changed. All remaining test bytes,
+programs, scenarios, events, frozen expectations and implementation are unchanged.
+
+The original capture and review bindings remain immutable records of commit
+504acdbe48cd08aee26caa8740329612b14bc682 and its reviewed source. Their old test
+header hash is historical. The new REVIEW-BINDING records fresh dispositions
+for the complete current candidate. No earlier approval carries forward.
+
+All CLI builds, tests and runtime comparisons remain UNRUN. Comparison admission
+is NOT_GRANTED and native authority remains zero. Source consistency and draft
+publication supply no circuit, financial, native, target or roadmap acceptance.
+The draft stays a draft. Existing fourteen-gap and projection-premise limits remain.
+
+After fresh reviews approve, Root may append only four exact review captures
+and a separate REVIEW-BINDING. No product or expectation byte may change.
