+# Independent normal oracle r2
+
+Status: **COMPLETE_CONTENT_UNDER_DISCLOSED_PROJECTION_PREMISE_REVIEW_PENDING**. Owner: `/root/mori_test_stages_oracle`, GPT-6.1 Sol high, independent normal-data author. These are six complete normal JSON report **candidates**, not observations. All source/product execution, actual-output comparison and tests remain **UNRUN**. Native authority remains **0**. Root owns full-freeze review, admission to any comparison, integration and publication.
