+TwoDeliveries values filled: transfer7, next phase1, accepted approval guard true, transfer3, accepted receipt guard true, next phase2, emit phase2. These values come from the literal source statements, event inputs, immediate-state semantics and r1's hand derivation. Its first/second/final boundaries remain phase1/alice13/bob7; phase1/alice10/bob10; phase2/alice10/bob10. Observer11/treasury0 and present duty5 persist. Segment work5/5/6 and cumulative committed5/10/16 remain unchanged. False approval still attempts2 with committed5 and has no segment.
