+QuotedFee values filled: let payable5, accepted quote guard true, fee5, next total5, emit payable5. Input4 plus1 was independently derived in r1; the captured5 supplies all suffix values. The waiting boundary keeps total0/marker9/payer20/treasury0/observer11. Completion has total5/marker9/payer15/treasury5/observer11 and present duty3. Segment work5/8 and committed5/13 remain unchanged. Financial accounting remains expected normal data only; this author supplies no financial-validity/security assessment.
