+### C1–C6 disposition
+
+- **C1:** Projection approval covers attachment/presence only. All twelve replacements are `Step.value` fields. Every other report field is taken directly from independently authored r1 data, whose separate representation premises remain disclosed below.
+- **C2:** Only Core/2 `run_segment` via existing start/resume is contemplated. Metered Core/1 and backend replay/`--trace` remain out of scope. No execution is authorized or performed by this packet.
